<title>FRANCE: Lafarge first quarter sales up 19.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Lafarge first quarter sales up 19.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 7.892    vs    6.605</p>
<p>    - cement					 3.550    vs    2.883</p>
<p>    - concrete and granulats		   2.054    vs    1.671</p>
<p>    - plaster					1.032    vs	781</p>
<p>    - special materials			  1.255    vs    1.269</p>
<p>NOTE - Lafarge said in a statement that on a constant currency basis sales would have been up by 15.7 percent. It said that due to seasonal effects the first quarter was not representative of the full year, especially because the first quarter of 1996 had been &quot;particulalrly mediocre&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
